jobs.description:
If you have a strong QA and Salesforce foundations but feel ready to take on more ownership, more client interaction, and more project responsibility, we’d love to hear from you. This role could be your next move. We have 15 internal products and multiple external projects
, so the role comes with plenty of variety: preparing demos, working with teams, presenting solutions to clients, supporting pre-sales, managing projects, and occasionally getting hands-on with QA.
Requirements
:
2+ years of experience as a QA Engineer;
1+ years of experience as a Project Manager;
Fluent English;
Working experience with Salesforce as power user;
Knowledge of testing theory, methodologies;
Experience in test documentation preparation (Test Cases, Checklist, Bug report, TRR);
Basic knowledge of QA processes automation with AI
Knowledge and understanding of software development process and life cycle;
Knowledge and work experience of Project Management practices and methodologies;
Working experience with JIRA.

Nice to have:

Salesforce certification (Admin, Developer, Consultant);
Certified Project Manager (CPM/PMP)
Certified SCRUM Master
Experience with Zephyr/Xray;
API testing experience (REST/SOAP), hands-on experience with Postman/SoapUI;

Key Responsibilities:

Project management activities;
Product Ownership activities
Requirements gathering and clarification
Salesforce Administration;
Participating in up-sales and pre-sales;
QA tasks (test planning, test documentation preparation, manual testing as required).

The company offers:

work in a team of experienced, motivated professionals;
bonuses for good performance on the project;
bonuses for length of service;
bonuses for getting professional certifications;
personalized onboarding and training plan with mentor;
corporate holiday gifts;
friendly and committed team;
flexible work schedule (ability to work remotely);
real prospects for career and professional growth;
training and certification at the expense of the company;
interesting activities within the company.

Working Conditions:

Full-time, Remote, B2B or incubator

